===Saudi Arabia vs Sweden===

Saudi Arabia suffered a major setback with the absence of captain [[Majed Abdullah]]. An early strike from [[Martin Dahlin]] in the first half and a second-half brace by [[Kennet Andersson]] saw Sweden go through to the quarterfinals. Substitute [[Fahad Al-Ghesheyan]] pulled one back for the Saudis five minutes from the end.<ref>[https://www.independent.co.uk/sport/football-world-cup-usa-94-andersson-sees-sweden-through-to-the-last-eight-1411576.html World Cup USA '94: Andersson sees Sweden through to the last eight]</ref>

